## #01 — The core was present
0036 already has Pack,Door,Job,Ask,Hostile,Check,Factfind,Overflow,Unprompted,Return,Pieces,Temp,Prime and a notes footer. All remain byte-identical.0064 already allows independent review and Director-authorized lane design. This design recovers these responsibilities rather than create competing Colab laws.

## #02 — Scores and opinion
0036 Ask /0038 require scores first;0036 Factfind confines solution opinion there. Director's current Colab intent includes open design and reasoned recommendations throughout the discussion. Proposed clarification:scores only for a declared scoring method; core findings and opinions labelled wherever relevant, preserving section distinction. Do not fabricate scores or hide a useful interpretation just to satisfy an old section boundary. Candidate wording/selection is future law work, not silently applied here.

## #03 — Context and source closure
0036 Door and0037 provide an entry order and bounded pages. Preserve that purpose while declaring the actual entry/input closure of each environment; an online ZIP recipient cannot open a local path. Missing/withheld dependencies need explicit classification.0036 Check's 'discard that halt' must not cause lost evidence about a broken pack; retain it as a pack defect rather than a design defect. This is proposed clarification.

## #04 — Fixed output shape versus meaningful outcomes
0036 returns/report and0040 lead preserve numbered findings, notes, jobs, why and Director replies. Keep meaningful scope/result/learning even when no numerical score applies. A rejected/deferred finding remains accounted for; no mandatory task pernote. Cite0039/0040 instead of replacing them with a second report law. Formal t2 protocol failure remains preserved alongside its comprehension findings.

## #05 — Roles and context
0064 responsibility already defines independence without requiring another family. New briefs should declare prior involvement/shared context/tool capabilities and actual boundaries. Open collaboration and blinded comparisons differ in allowed context; both are valid methods. No role or permission inferred from a model label or an old prompt.

## Status
All five are source-linked recovery/alignment findings, not seated law edits. Any future0036 amendment must retain or disposition every source section and show why/authorization/destination. Current runtime and law selectors unchanged.


